<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 5,000 tonnes US sorghum for Kenya.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 5,000 tonnes US sorghum for Kenya.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it would tender on April 22 for up to 5,000 tonnes of U.S. sorghum for export to Kenya, May 5-31 shipment.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
